# Keep every text file LF in the working tree as well as the repository.
#
# The build is committed (`lib/`), and the shipped `install.sh` must not gain
# CRLF endings on a Windows checkout: bash treats a CR as part of the command
# name and the script fails with "bad interpreter" or "command not found".
# Declaring `eol=lf` makes the checkout deterministic regardless of the
# contributor's `core.autocrlf` setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets that must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
